      "statement_id": "claim-1",
      "text": "The source introduces amortized variational inference with the reparameterization trick: a probabilistic encoder q_phi(z|x) (MLP, Gaussian) and decoder p_theta(x|z), prior N(0,I), trained by stochastic-gradient variational Bayes (SGVB estimators, analytic KL).",
